// Title: Run PowerShell Script from Redirected Input Stream
// Rule ID: c83bf4b5-cdf0-437c-90fa-43d734f7c476
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.execution, attack.t1059
// Category: process_creation
